  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "User profile details in the new main menu UI take up so much space that user worlds are off-screen by default, making it impossible to tell if a user has uploaded any worlds until scrolling down.\n\nIf you find someone with only one line in their bio and no language/link details, you can see the very top of the Worlds section on their profile, but even this is misleading because the section appears even if that user has \"No worlds to show\". (picture attached, user doesn't have any worlds uploaded nor publicly favorited)\n\nI would really like a way to immediately see if a user has worlds uploaded. Pushing the user worlds section out-of-view makes it seem not important and I worry people won't discover worlds that way anymore.",
